05:26.250 --> 05:26.690
Baik.

05:29.250 --> 05:30.300
Kalau begitu, aku pulang dulu.

05:36.730 --> 05:37.170
Banxia.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.360
Malam sangat gelap.

05:44.720 --> 05:45.680
Berjalanlah perlahan-lahan.

05:48.830 --> 05:49.480
Aku tahu.

05:50.120 --> 05:51.090
Setelah aku pergi,

05:51.390 --> 05:52.750
